y agent artifact index[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A detached agent runner survives a transiently busy agent artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]index or dismissed-bundle index instead of failing its launch, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]while hot callers keep bounded single-attempt lookups, fail-closed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]semantics hold, runner failure hints are typed and honest, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]next busy failure names its SQLite lock class.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]launch_lookup_busy_resilience.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/launch_lookup_busy_resilience.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1vh[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1vh/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Opt-in busy patience at the lookup facades, installed by the [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]agent runner[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]runner-lookup-patience[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]runner-lookup-patience: add a process-wide LookupPatience policy and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retry_while_busy helper, wrap the artifact and dismissed-bundle lookup [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]facades so busy-incomplete results retry with capped backoff under [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]patience, install it in the agent runner entry with concise retry log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lines, and test the default single-attempt path stays unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Typed host lookup failures, provider-retry exclusion, honest [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]runner hint[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]typed-transient-classification[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed-transient-classification: add an IndexLookupUnavailable base with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a transient flag for both lookup exceptions, exclude host lookup [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures from provider retry via is_host_owned_failure, and make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record_runner_error print a typed transient or index-repair hint instead[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of the coincidental provider match.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]SQLite extended codes in sase-core busy lookup diagnostics[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]busy-diagnostics[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]busy-diagnostics: in sase-core, decorate busy/locked SQLite errors on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the artifact-index and dismissed-bundle lookup read paths with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extended code, keeping busy classification, wire shapes, and bindings [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1vh","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1vh.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-cd2ada4761df58fa057c7107de5ccf2c","started_at":"2026-11-26T19:48:57.520172+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vh","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vh.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vh.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vh.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vh.land"]}
